 "preheader": {
  "zh": "他明知是对手设的局，却抢先保举：李鸿章的一次妥协，和此后几年没买成的军舰。",
  "en": "He knew it was a rival's move, yet he endorsed it first: one compromise by Li Hongzhang, and the warships China then went years without buying."
